{"counts":{"canonical":5,"context":0,"total":5,"unknown_date":0,"unlinked":0},"events":[{"aliases":["Archaeological Site of Mehrgarh","泥砖","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-bf2f7311a77f802426eb3684","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-bf2f7311a77f802426eb3684","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5772d60dd6f8b81bb35ec734","summary":"梅赫尔格尔位于今巴基斯坦俾路支省的卡奇平原，靠近博兰山口和博兰河。这里保存了跨公元前第七至第三千纪的长期考古序列，地层深逾十一米。多代居民反复营建泥砖建筑，旧屋遗存被新建筑覆盖，逐渐累积成今天看到的聚落土丘。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前第七至第三千纪","end_year":-2001,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-7000},"title":"梅赫尔格尔群体连续营建泥砖聚落"},{"aliases":["Xinglongwa and Zhaobaogou spindle whorls","纺织","纺轮"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-a95423997412903ea4cf6ebe","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a95423997412903ea4cf6ebe","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-7357710d6d174e410102b893","summary":"约公元前6200至前4500年，西辽河地区的兴隆洼、赵宝沟文化中已经使用纺轮。考古研究把它们视为纺线技术的线索：部分器物呈中间穿孔的扁圆形，常见素面，也有由陶片改制者。纺轮的出现和延续，使史前织物虽不易保存，制作纤维线的工具仍能留下痕迹。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前6200—前4500年","end_year":-4500,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-6200},"title":"兴隆洼至赵宝沟时期的纺轮使用"},{"aliases":["Early Plains Archaic","食物","环境适应"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["北美大平原"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-4070732f6deb2a7d3d2c2708","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-4070732f6deb2a7d3d2c2708","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-8f147befdcb86f09bb7979b3","summary":"约公元前5600至前3000年，北美大平原早期古风时期的人群仍大量依赖野牛，同时更常利用鱼类、鸟类和浆果。当地生计并非始终不变：早期猎人已经发展出步行协作驱赶猎物及使用投射工具的办法，河谷和草原的不同资源也共同进入食物来源。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5600年—公元前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5600},"title":"北美大平原早期古风时期的食物利用"},{"aliases":["The Ubaid Period (5500–4000 B.C.)","灌溉","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["两河流域"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-716ecc9c02fe599e72ce3b0b","images":[{"caption":"乌拜德文化陶碗，约公元前第六千纪中叶至第五千纪。大都会艺术博物馆藏，编号49.133.9。","creator":"摄影者未单列；馆藏影像提供：The Metropolitan Museum of Art","credit":"The Metropolitan Museum of Art；Rogers Fund, by exchange, 1949；CC0 1.0","depiction_type":"museum_object_photograph","license":"CC0 1.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","obligations":[],"rights_revision_url":null,"sha256":"57bfd6fd03c221ee595a7bdca8155f6d6c7dd38e9dbfae7372a76f91f20ce601","source_url":"https://www.metmuseum.org/art/collection/search/324093","src":"/api/history/assets/AS-57bfd6fd03c221ee595a7bdca8155f6d6c7dd38e9dbfae7372a76f91f20ce601.jpg"}],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-716ecc9c02fe599e72ce3b0b","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5b8b4cbdcc5979e68f7cab2d","summary":"约公元前5500至前4000年，两河流域许多地区共享乌拜德文化，其名称来自发现相关遗存的地点。南部冲积平原的居民利用灌溉耕种土地，同时在河流和波斯湾捕鱼。具有特色的陶器把分散聚落联系在共同的物质文化范围之中。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5500—前4000年","end_year":-4000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5500},"title":"乌拜德村落实行灌溉农业并出现城镇聚落"},{"aliases":["Chinchorro","丧葬","遗体处理"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["钦乔罗文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5497db2bba26e3b36f16fc2b","summary":"钦乔罗文化的海洋狩猎采集群体，约在公元前5450至前890年生活于今智利北部干旱的阿塔卡马沿海。海洋资源是其生计的重要基础，遗址中发现用骨、贝壳以及矿物和植物材料制作的工具，也保存了格外复杂的葬俗证据。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5450—前890年","end_year":-890,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5450},"title":"钦乔罗海洋采集群体发展人工木乃伊葬俗"}],"revision":"16e2d9bc7dac753e8ae63fc6d7d5464fd2e2ef9bb6dc2e0855171d4b9b35d835","schema_version":"1.0.0","scope":"public_database","sources":[],"time_bounds":{"max_year":2026,"min_year":-10000}}